{"seq":2,"slug":"eulerian-vs-lagrangian","title":"网格法与粒子法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/foundations/eulerian-vs-lagrangian","wordCount":1567,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"网格法与粒子法\">网格法与粒子法</h1><p>想象你要测一条河的流速。第一种办法：在河里钉一排桩子，每根桩子上装流速计，盯着「这个固定位置」的水流过得多快——这是欧拉视角。第二种办法：往河里扔一堆带 GPS 的浮标，跟着每个浮标记录它去了哪、走多快——这是拉格朗日视角。两种视角描述的是同一条河，但落到代码里会变成两套截然不同的数据结构、邻域策略和擅长场景。游戏流体的所有求解器，骨子里都是在这两种视角之间选边或缝合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两种视角的对立\">核心概念：两种视角的对立</h2><p>欧拉（Eulerian）把空间切成固定的格子，流体属性——速度、密度、压力——存在格子上，水穿过格子但格子不动。拉格朗日（Lagrangian）把流体切成会移动的粒子，属性存在粒子上，粒子走到哪属性带到哪，空间本身不被离散。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[同一团流体] --&gt; B[欧拉视角&lt;br/&gt;固定格子&lt;br/&gt;看流过的量]&#10;  A --&gt; C[拉格朗日视角&lt;br/&gt;移动粒子&lt;br/&gt;跟着团跑]&#10;  B --&gt; D[网格存速度密度&lt;br/&gt;平流靠回溯采样]&#10;  C --&gt; E[粒子带速度质量&lt;br/&gt;平流天然免费]&#10;  D --&gt; F[体积守恒好&lt;br/&gt;表面追踪难]&#10;  E --&gt; G[飞溅自由表面天然&lt;br/&gt;压力场易抖]\">graph TD\n  A[同一团流体] --&gt; B[欧拉视角&lt;br/&gt;固定格子&lt;br/&gt;看流过的量]\n  A --&gt; C[拉格朗日视角&lt;br/&gt;移动粒子&lt;br/&gt;跟着团跑]\n  B --&gt; D[网格存速度密度&lt;br/&gt;平流靠回溯采样]\n  C --&gt; E[粒子带速度质量&lt;br/&gt;平流天然免费]\n  D --&gt; F[体积守恒好&lt;br/&gt;表面追踪难]\n  E --&gt; G[飞溅自由表面天然&lt;br/&gt;压力场易抖]</pre><p>这张图的关键在底部两行：两种视角的强弱几乎是镜像互补的。欧拉的水「装在格子里跑不掉」所以体积守恒天然好，但「水面在哪」要额外用 level set 之类去追踪；拉格朗日的「粒子飞出去就是水花」所以自由表面和飞溅免费，但要让一群粒子保持不可压缩很费劲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平流-两种视角的分水岭\">平流：两种视角的分水岭</h2><p>平流（advection，流体把自身属性随速度场搬运）是看清两种视角差异的最好切口。</p>\n<p>拉格朗日里平流几乎不要钱：粒子带着自己的速度，位置直接 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>←</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{x} \\leftarrow \\vec{x} + \\vec{v}\\,\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 更新就行，属性随粒子走，没有任何数值损耗。这是粒子法最迷人的优点——它不会把速度场「抹糊」。</p>\n<p>欧拉里平流是个麻烦。格子不动，要知道「下一帧这个格子里的速度该是多少」，标准做法是半拉格朗日回溯（Stam 2003）：从格子中心往回追一个时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\vec{v}\\,\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，在那个回溯点上插值采样旧速度搬过来。公式上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^{n+1}(\\vec{x}) = q^{n}\\big(\\vec{x} - \\vec{v}\\,\\Delta t\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这步无条件稳定（再大的时间步也不会爆），但插值会引入数值耗散——速度场一帧帧被抹平，漩涡慢慢消失，水看起来越来越「黏」。这正是 FLIP/PIC 要发明出来的动机：用粒子做平流躲开耗散，用网格做别的。这条线索会在<a href=\"../methods/flip-pic-hybrid\">FLIP/PIC 混合法</a>里收口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"邻域问题-谁是我的邻居\">邻域问题：谁是我的邻居</h2><p>两种视角在「找邻居」上也对称地难。</p>\n<p>欧拉里邻居是免费的：格子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i,j,k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的邻居就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i\\pm1,j,k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 等等，数组下标一加就到，这让压力投影那种「问周围格子要数据」的操作极快——这是欧拉法解不可压缩的底气，详见<a href=\"../methods/grid-solvers\">网格求解与投影</a>。</p>\n<p>拉格朗日里邻居是昂贵的：粒子在连续空间里乱飞，要算某个粒子受周围哪些粒子影响，朴素做法是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 两两比较，几万粒子就跑不动。所以 SPH 必须配一套空间加速结构——均匀网格哈希或紧凑哈希——把搜索降到近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。2025 年一项在 Unity 里的大规模粒子工作就靠 Count Sort 加并行前缀扫描做空间哈希，把传统 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 邻域搜索压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，从而突破十万粒子还保持实时（<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2076-3417/15/17/9706\">MDPI, Applied Sciences 2025</a>）。这套加速结构的工程细节会在<a href=\"../practice/fluid-performance\">流体性能与 LOD</a>展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各自的擅长场景\">各自的擅长场景</h2><p>把两种视角的取舍落到游戏需求上，选择其实相当清晰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求特征</th>\n<th>欧拉（网格）更优</th>\n<th>拉格朗日（粒子）更优</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大体积连续水（湖、容器内水）</td>\n<td>✓ 体积守恒好</td>\n<td>粒子要很多才填满</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四处飞溅的水花、喷泉</td>\n<td>格子外的水难表达</td>\n<td>✓ 飞出去就是水花</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>烟雾、火（气态、看密度场）</td>\n<td>✓ 经典网格强项</td>\n<td>表面无意义，少用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大时间步要稳定</td>\n<td>✓ 半拉格朗日无条件稳</td>\n<td>需 PBF 等约束才稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自由表面、液滴分裂合并</td>\n<td>要额外 level set</td>\n<td>✓ 拓扑变化天然</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 高度并行</td>\n<td>✓ 格子规整好并行</td>\n<td>邻域不规则，需哈希</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验法则：以「连续大块、装在边界里」为主的水偏欧拉；以「破碎、飞溅、自由表面」为主的水偏拉格朗日；两者都要时，就是 FLIP/PIC 出场的信号。具体的纯粒子方案见<a href=\"../methods/sph-particles\">SPH 粒子流体</a>，纯网格方案见<a href=\"../methods/grid-solvers\">网格求解与投影</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么游戏最终常常缝合两者\">为什么游戏最终常常缝合两者</h2><p>纯欧拉和纯粒子在游戏里都有硬伤：纯欧拉的半拉格朗日平流耗散太重，水看起来死气沉沉、缺乏细节；纯粒子（朴素 SPH）的压力场抖动、体积不易守恒，大块水会「呼吸」般膨胀收缩。</p>\n<p>工业界的答案几乎总是「取长补短」。FLIP/PIC 用粒子扛平流（无耗散）、用网格解压力（好守恒、邻域免费）；现代 MPM（Material Point Method，物质点法）更进一步，让粒子和背景网格在每帧之间来回传递，能同时处理水、雪、沙。这些混合法之所以成为高端实时与离线（Houdini）的标准，根源就在于本篇讲的视角互补——它们不是某个聪明 trick，而是对「欧拉强在哪、拉格朗日强在哪」的系统性回应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>欧拉盯固定格子看流过的量，拉格朗日跟着移动粒子跑——同一团水的两种世界观。</li>\n<li>平流是分水岭：粒子平流免费无耗散，网格平流要半拉格朗日回溯且会抹糊速度场。</li>\n<li>邻域问题对称地难：网格邻居靠下标免费，粒子邻居要空间哈希才降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>选边规则：连续大块的水偏欧拉，破碎飞溅的水偏拉格朗日，两者都要就缝成 FLIP/PIC。</li>\n<li>缝合不是技巧而是对视角互补的系统回应，这是现代高端流体的事实标准。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"navier-stokes-intuition\">NS 方程直觉</a>、<a href=\"../methods/sph-particles\">SPH 粒子流体</a>、<a href=\"../methods/grid-solvers\">网格求解与投影</a>、<a href=\"../methods/flip-pic-hybrid\">FLIP/PIC 混合法</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/spatial-acceleration\">空间加速结构</a>、<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented\">数据导向与缓存</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网格法与粒子法","id":"网格法与粒子法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两种视角的对立","id":"核心概念-两种视角的对立"},{"level":2,"text":"平流：两种视角的分水岭","id":"平流-两种视角的分水岭"},{"level":2,"text":"邻域问题：谁是我的邻居","id":"邻域问题-谁是我的邻居"},{"level":2,"text":"各自的擅长场景","id":"各自的擅长场景"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么游戏最终常常缝合两者","id":"为什么游戏最终常常缝合两者"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"游戏流体基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/foundations/fluid-basics-games"},"next":{"title":"NS 方程直觉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/foundations/navier-stokes-intuition"}}